rooms_desc ({"Slipping and sliding along the path you get to the waterfall and enter it.  Torrents of water pulsate onyou. Upon entering a tingling sensation surrounds you,a glow fills your senses..your dry, and at peace.  Thiscave is pretty empty, dust is everywheres and throughthe haze you can just make out a very old machine thathums and pulsates softly.  There is red glowing button on the front that says 'press at your own risk'.....should you?","Upon entering a light beam shines upon you and grows brighter and brighter, you feel strange,a sick feeling rolls around you....you scream in terroras you are held immobile, you cannot move. Suddenly the light flashes and you again find yourselfin a strange place and there are glowing portals are in all directions","With a flash of light, an energy pulsates through you and your transported to your destination.  Its sandy,hot and very arrid. For miles and miles there tall sand dunes and you feel so lonely. But as your eyes clear  more you can make out a weather beaten tent, a smallstagnent pool of water, and a dirty camel thirstlydrinking.  ","This tent is quite luxurious despite its outwardappearance.  Quite large infact.  Brightly coloreddownfilled cushions are laying in one corner.  A smalltable is in the center with a refreshing pitcher ofwine, fruit and nuts laid upon it.  Candles shed their soft glow and insense fills the air with a delightful aroma.  A soft pulsating circular light isto the east. Should you check it out?","Upon entering a light beam shines upon you and grows brighter and brighter, you feel strange,a sick feeling rolls around you....you scream in terroras you are held immobile, you cannot move. Suddenly the light flashes and you again find yourselfin a strange place and there are glowing doors in all directions","With a flash of light, an energy pulsates through andyou feel like your body is fragmented into a millionpieces as you arrive at your destination.  Hey, yourfloating, feel light as a feather. What is going on here? Gazing around you see a small circular room withmany tiny windows.  There is an open steel door north.","This cabin is very comfortable looking and a melodiousvoice whispers to you 'Welcome to the ship Volcanya'.Make yourself comfortable for it may take years to reachyour destination.  In one corner is the ships computer,which hums and beeps at you. A comfortable looking waterbed lies against one wall. A small table with ivorychess set and two glasses is in another corner and a food-o-cyclar is next to it. A door leads into a small wardrobecloset.","Your at the end of a long line....wonder how long this will take.The smell of some awesome cooking makes your stomach grumble a bit.Ahead of you is the worlds greatest rides ever made.  Its called the \"Hearts Desire\".  As you look at it you wonder whattype of a ride it might be and is it safe to enter.","Stepping lightly up you gaze around at the slowly turning carosel.You giggle lightly to see that the horses bow magically before you.You beckon your special somone to join you in a chariot...pulled bya team of glistening white horses and decorated with brilliant white orchids.  The music playing merrily in the background is thetune of \"You will always be beautiful in my eyes and sounds charmingas you feel the breeze touch your face lightly.  You can exitwhenever you like.  Be careful as the platform revolves slowly andstep off at your exit.","Hearing the sounds of cascading water you peeraround in amazement. Before you is a gorgeous waterfallcascading into a sparkling crystal clear pond. The groundis rock strewn and sheer craggy cliffs surround it. Pinkwaterlillies float on the ponds surface, goldfish swimwithin.  Frogs ribbit a merry tune.  A small path takesyou to the waterfall and disappears at the edge..shouldyou explore it?   ",})
